Golden's safe line (Empty+Color)/2+6500 (= 6866 here) is the 9046 layout: on HT9050 every move to Empty (7532) and Loader (191213) was refused ('TrayArm moves 7532 to the left error', 22:23:45), which stopped the Loader hand-over and Empty -> Auto. Motor/mymotor.cpp TrayArmMotorMove, HT9050 (9050GPIB or Type_HT9050): Loader beyond every Auto, Empty beyond every Auto on the other side, an Auto between Empty and Loader, anything else inside [Empty, Loader]; the sides come from the teach values; a violation shows the box and refuses. HOME still passes bCheckPos=false. Other machines: golden. Same line.
tests/test_flow9050_tray.cpp: teach values in the HT9050 order; new [TS] block (5 checks). Flow9050_Tray 110/110, W6_3_CatchTray passed. Release linked; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program). WORKLOG row 191.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
